     "value": "Read-only spectator feed: the @cogame/core ServerMessage stream the live console and replay viewer render. Each round advances through talk \u2192 negotiate \u2192 vote \u2192 govern phases, emitting feed events (talk, negotiate, vote, election, govern, income, phase) plus per-seat balance snapshots. The saved replay is `{ protocol: \"cogame.replay.v1\", frames: ServerMessage[] }`. Spectators send nothing."
